 Basic Cybersecurity Checklist

Use this checklist to improve your everyday security.

 Account Security
- [ ] Use strong, unique passwords.
- [ ] Enable multifactor authentication.
- [ ] Never share passwords or verification codes.
- [ ] Change compromised passwords promptly.

 Email and Internet Safety
- [ ] Check unexpected emails carefully.
- [ ] Avoid suspicious links and attachments.
- [ ] Verify urgent requests independently.
- [ ] Use trusted websites and secure connections.

 Device Security
- [ ] Install software and security updates.
- [ ] Use reputable security software.
- [ ] Lock your device when not in use.
- [ ] Back up important files regularly.

 Incident Response
- [ ] Report suspicious activity to IT support.
- [ ] If credentials are exposed, change them using the official service and notify IT.

Remember: Prevention is better than recovery.
